1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,000
I dropped out in grade 9 because the system
wasn't built for a brain like mine.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:22,500
Spent 23 years putting material on steel across Edmonton,
Fort Mac, Suncor, and the Walterdale Bridge—NACE Level 2.

3
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:33,000
Four years waiting for a government letter
to confirm what I already knew.

4
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Cree dad, white mom, accepted by neither side. My brain
can't do long division, so I built a fixed-point engine.

5
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Walk downtown Edmonton past the Ice District casino.
Half a block away, people are suffering.

6
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Tech builds $3,000 tools for people with endless runway,
ignoring those who have had everything taken away.

7
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Can't recover under the current rules.
Diagnosed with AuDHD at 39.

8
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Computer processor can't do floating-point math without drifting.
So I built a fixed-point engine.

9
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:42,000
I took a consequence demo to Alberta Innovates,
and the Professional Engineer looked at me and said:

10
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:52,000
'There is nothing I can do to help you.
There is no one I can refer you to.'

11
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:03,000
So I sat in the dark for 8 months with no runway,
no CS degree, and no support.

12
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:15,000
And I forged 1 million lines
of #![no_std] Rust.

13
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:26,000
14 scattered domains collapsed into one truth.
Millions of tokens per second on a single core,

14
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:37,000
backed by Gemini on the cloud. This is software
for the people left behind.

15
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:48,000
For those who didn't get to learn Cree.
Human error, not computational rounding error.

16
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:59,000
Accountability is self-attestation,
not surveillance.

17
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,000
No ending is silent.
